Invalid JSX
function App() {
  return (
    <h1>Hello</h1>
    <p>Welcome</p>
  );
}

export default App;

This is invalid because JSX must return one parent element.

Correct version:
function App() {
  return (
    <div>
      <h1>Hello</h1>
      <p>Welcome</p>
    </div>
     );
}

export default App;